/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093650.351.png?v=1743518228&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093650.351.png?v=1743518228&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093650.351.png?v=1743518228&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093650.351.png?v=1743518228&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093650.351.png?v=1743518228&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.75" width="1050" height="600" sizes="75vw" data-action="url" data-href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-hTUXFl kHZQAV pf-41_" store="[object Object]"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-42_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:30px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-43_"><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-44_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong></strong>Did you know there's a new device the size of your thumb that can backup thousands of photos and videos from any device, in just 1-click?<br><br><b>FOR THE PAST FEW YEARS, THE PHOTO &amp; VIDEO BACKUP INDUSTRY HAD JUST A FEW BIG COMPANIES THAT COULD SET ANY PRICES THEY WANTED AND KEPT RIPPING OFF CUSTOMERS.<br></b><br>A genius company is turning this $5 billion dollar photo and video backup industry on its head.<br><br>The company called ThePhotoStick® has figured out a way to offer a far superior product (even the biggest tech experts agree) at a fraction of the price.<br><br>With <b>over 35% of Americans</b> having never once backed up their computer or phone, all it takes is a broken or lost device to <b>lose years worth of memories</b>. It’s no surprise why ThePhotoStick Omni has become so incredibly popular.<br><br>With ThePhotoStick Omni, you don’t need to be a tech expert and you <b>don’t need to shell out monthly fees</b> for cloud storage. It’s quickly becoming the <b>most successful backup solution of the year.</b></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk pf-46_ pf-heading-1-h3">What Is It?</h3><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-48_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Meet <strong><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a>.</strong></p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T104607.616.png?v=1743522464" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T104607.616.png?v=1743522464 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T104607.616_500x.png?v=1743522464 320w" width="1050" height="600" alt="ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB" data-action="url" data-href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-dycZeM jfmvQi pf-50_ pf-image-1"/><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-51_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>It was created by a former HP executive</b> who lost his phone on family vacation, along with all the photos, videos, and priceless memories he had on it.<br><br>His goal was to make <b>a low cost, easy to use photo and video backup solution</b>, that anyone could use to save their precious memories.<br><br>With no monthly fees or ongoing costs, a <b>free easy to use app</b> that finds and organizes hidden or lost files,  and compatibility with virtually every device (iPhones, iPads, Androids, PCs, Macs, etc), <b><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a></b> is an engineering masterpiece.<br><br>It’s leagues ahead of any ordinary flash drive.<br><br>And it’s <b>much</b> <b>safer, secure, and cheaper than cloud storage.</b></p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T104910.789.png?v=1743522560" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T104910.789.png?v=1743522560 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T104910.789_500x.png?v=1743522560 320w" width="1050" height="600" alt="ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB" data-action="url" data-href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-dycZeM jfmvQi pf-53_ pf-image-1"/><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-54_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">So, what can it actually do?<br><br>At first glance, ThePhotoStick Omni  looks like a regular USB drive… but it’s MUCH more than that.<br><br><strong><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a></strong> actually contains a powerful program that finds, downloads, and safely stores photos and videos on any device — in a single click!</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk pf-56_ pf-heading-1-h3">How Does It Work?</h3><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-58_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">I’ll let you in on a little secret: I have no idea how ThePhotoStick Omni ACTUALLY works. (I’m not what you’d call a computer person…)<br><br>But I did test it out for myself and let me just say, I<strong> was shocked by how easy it was.</strong><br><br>All I have to do is plug it in, open the app and tap a button to start my backup.<br><br>Then it automatically searches my phone and computer and saves my photo and video files onto the stick.<strong><br></strong></p><img alt="ThePhotoStick Omni Adapter" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.75" width="1050" height="600" sizes="75vw" data-action="url" data-href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-hTUXFl kHZQAV pf-60_" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-61_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">It works with all my devices, too — thanks to a <strong>3-headed attachment that makes it completely universal</strong>.<br><br>Meaning it’s guaranteed to work with nearly all your devices. This attachment simply fits onto the end of the stick.<br><br>Now I can keep everything in <strong>one secure, physical location</strong>. Any time I want to look at my precious memories, I just plug in ThePhotoStick Omni — and they’re all there neatly organized for me!<br><br>Once it collects all my files, I toss ThePhotoStick Omni in my top desk drawer. No longer do I have to safekeep entire boxes of family photo albums to keep our family memories stored away.<br><br>And unlike the digital files previously stored on my computer (which, by th